258 0 obj
<<
/Alt (Flowchart illustrating a basketball study. The process begins with a familiarization session involving anthropometrics, HRmax assessment, and scales for match familiarization. After a one-week transition, participants are divided into experienced and non-experienced players for basketball matches. Post-match, RPE and enjoyment levels are recorded. In-match monitoring assesses physical demands and percentage of HRmax.)
/ID (ID.0032)
